
The auto-charge system (`on_turn_start`, `on_turn_end` via `AutoGainCharges()`) handles the timing requirement naturally — Seer's Orb gets 1 charge at turn start (before draw, so the draw-2 on full happens immediately), and Constellation Starlight gets 1 charge at turn end (so 3 turns to charge, then Starfall triggers and resets).
